---
// Hero, ported field-for-field from reference/home.html's <section class="hero"
// id="top"> (data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf). Includes the ambient glow drifts, the
// 5-column animated "shelf" of product bottles, and the two-column flavor-name
// ticker underneath it — all in one component because that's how the source
// actually nests them (NOTES.md: the brief's separate "#categories ticker"
// section doesn't exist; this ticker lives inside the hero, and id="categories"
// on the real site is the six-lines module instead).
